# Ignore file of docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile
# instead of .dockerignore in the build context). Paths are relative to the build context (the
# repository root).
# Allow-list: only what the image needs is sent to the build context.
*
!pixi.toml
!pixi.lock
!config.yaml
!src/
**/__pycache__/
**/DECISIONS.md
